@PrintDebateText Text:请大家<br>再次回想一下<br>留在现场的那幅画。<br>很清晰地画着<br>蝴蝶的图案，对吧？|#0101Trial02_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@PrintDebateText Text:而玛格她的衣服上面……<br>就有蝴蝶的装饰。|#0101Trial02_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我领到的<br>衣服上面<br>的确有蝴蝶元素的装饰<br>没错。|#0101Trial02_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:"是的……<br>也就是说，那幅画是<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_02_01\">诺亚</link>她在<link=\"Objection_01_01_02_02\">死前</link>，<br>为了揭发<br>玛格是<link=\"Objection_01_01_02_03\">凶手</link><br>而留下的死亡讯息！|#0101Trial02_Sherry003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR13,ArmL4
@PrintDebateText Text:宝生玛格！<br>凶手就是你！|#0101Trial02_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR7,ArmL3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:哦，是这样吗。<br>连我也不知道呢♪|#0101Trial02_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
